## Multi-agent working style

Delegation-first: the main agent is the architect; `scout` explores, `worker` applies
specs, `verifier` runs gates; cross-model review through a Codex lane. Single-level agent
tree. Durable syntheses go to `{{REPORTS_DIR}}/`, worker recipes to `{{SPECS_DIR}}/`,
repeated procedures become skills. The full rules and the why:
`docs/agent-working-rules.md`.

